Big Bob was added in '''Beta 6.6'''. Upon release, its ability was that it would summon another Big Bob if it survived taking damage. This new Big Bob was a base version of it, being 2/3. '''Beta 13.1''' buffed that by making any new Big Bobs keep the ATK buffs of the original one, while still keeping their own 3 HP. '''Beta 45.1''' reverted this buff. '''Beta 49.0''' reverted that back again.
[[File:Big Bob (Beta 45.1).png|thumb|291x291px|Beta 45.1]]

